#ASSERT `Have I met the coroner's requirement in time` (`d` 1 3 2027) (`d` 15 3 2027) TRUE (`d` 1 3 2027) (`d` 20 3 2027) EQUALS `done in time`
#ASSERT `Have I met the coroner's requirement in time` (`d` 1 3 2027) (`d` 15 3 2027) TRUE (`d` 16 3 2027) (`d` 20 3 2027) EQUALS `not done in time`
#ASSERT `Have I met the coroner's requirement in time` (`d` 1 3 2027) (`d` 15 3 2027) FALSE (`d` 1 1 2000) (`d` 15 3 2027) EQUALS `still open`
#ASSERT `Have I met the coroner's requirement in time` (`d` 1 3 2027) (`d` 15 3 2027) FALSE (`d` 1 1 2000) (`d` 16 3 2027) EQUALS `not done in time`

