§§ `Part 7 -- appeals`

`s78` MEANS `a determination that the death is not a reportable death (s 78)`
`s79a` MEANS `a direction that an autopsy be performed (s 79(1))`
`s79b` MEANS `a refusal to direct an autopsy (s 79(3))`
`s80` MEANS `a determination not to investigate a fire (s 80)`
`s81a` MEANS `an authorisation of an exhumation (s 81(1))`
`s81b` MEANS `a refusal to authorise an exhumation (s 81(3))`
`s82` MEANS `a determination not to hold an inquest (s 82)`
`s83` MEANS `the findings of a coroner (s 83)`
`s84` MEANS `a refusal to set aside findings or re-open an investigation (s 84)`
`s84A` MEANS `a refusal to re-open a discontinued investigation (s 84A)`
`s85` MEANS `an order releasing a body, or its terms (s 85)`

